# .cursorrules

AI instructions for this project live in `AGENTS.md` at the repo root — read that first.

For Cursor Agent mode, the reliable always-on adapter is `.cursor/rules/agents.mdc` (`alwaysApply: true`). This `.cursorrules` file is kept for compatibility only.
